== Trivia ==
*'''Researcher Kay''' appears to be another version of {{NPCSprite|Kay}} from the [[Rift Dimension]], due to the similarities in their names, dialogue, and skins.
* The platform that '''Researcher Kay''' yeets the player up to features {{NPCSprite|Researcher Tay}}, who can then yeet the player back down to the island.

